      "en": "They passed over the Jordan and encamped in Aroer, on the right side of the city that is in the middle of the valley of Gad, and to Jazer;",
      "ko": "요단을 건너 갓 골짜기 가운데 성읍 아로엘 우편 곧 야셀 맞은편에 이르러 장막을 치고",
      "source_text_hash": "9d4f675519c98e8aad3ec7e9442400f3d96fc7d25b91ad15dfb6cd9cc49208c0",
      "translation_text_hash": "eb1f8ba01136d648663f229cb71b3ea9a7ebe7d5e4c7b75e7a2a6073c9a9acb7",
