        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 24,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "So when they had gone back and forth through all the land, they came to Jerusalem at the end of nine months and twenty days.",
      "ko": "저희 무리가 국중을 두루 돌아 아홉달 스무날만에 예루살렘에 이르러",
      "source_text_hash": "9f61967e7099d3d82a02cc8d48b7ab85377d894933fcf569ef36c62ff245cc3e",
      "translation_text_hash": "813991d4e7a5db4cb87b9436058d15d479bb05ca438a317a1b8dd32f61e3599c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
