      "en": "David went up according to the saying of Gad, as the LORD commanded.",
      "ko": "다윗이 여호와의 명하신바 갓의 말대로 올라가니라",
      "source_text_hash": "4b3165a8ce20de963c2a9412547c07b3b28757b04add151a0d650b7a07f2071a",
