      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 24,
          "verse": 20
        }
      ],
      "en": "Araunah looked out, and saw the king and his servants coming on toward him. Then Araunah went out and bowed himself before the king with his face to the ground.",
      "ko": "아라우나가 바라보다가 왕과 그 신복들이 자기를 향하여 옴을 보고 나가서 왕의 앞에서 얼굴을 땅에 대고 절하며",
      "source_text_hash": "da14fe071bc3e3d32b091aacc5aafae7370c844976da507036c07f8faa435356",
      "translation_text_hash": "87d176ca3a1d86da18b3d8a2653614056a3d40b8f3d310e7166c3389bf7f49a6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
