          "chapter": 24,
          "verse": 21
        }
      ],
      "en": "Araunah said, “Why has my lord the king come to his servant?” David said, “To buy your threshing floor, to build an altar to the LORD, that the plague may be stopped from afflicting the people.”",
      "ko": "가로되 어찌하여 내 주 왕께서 종에게 임하시나이까 다윗이 가로되 네게서 타작마당을 사서 여호와께 단을 쌓아 백성에게 내리는 재앙을 그치게 하려 함이로라",
      "source_text_hash": "49c367a0f19b7ab0e82c1760600982c30eacbbb63a6b18b401e3c52d0bfbee2a",
      "translation_text_hash": "f5525ac05169be2ca09255a7ceaafda11b4d5f7f28204648975654b037440e11",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
